<h1>Welcome</h1>

<h4>
    I am a Software Engineer specializing in .NET backend systems, with a strong focus on cloud-native microservice architectures. I build systems that support scale and enjoy working close to production environments. I value team work, ownership, and taking responsibility for delivering solutions that work.
</h4>

    <h2>What I Do</h2>
<p>
My day-to-day work involves building and maintaining .NET microservice applications, connecting them with Kafka, and deploying them on Kubernetes. I regularly work with high-throughput event-driven systems and troubleshoot complex production systems.
</p>
<p>
I have experience in cloud-native applications deployed on Microsoft Azure, including designing and implementing microservice components such as Kafka-based data adapters and processing services.
</p>
<p>
    Beyond development, I am actively involved in debugging and monitoring systems in production using observability tools such as Grafana, Kibana, and Kafka UI tools (Kowl/Redpanda). I am comfortable working in environments where reliability and fast incident response are critical.
</p>

